Well,

	we have no limits for further development of ALSA drivers or 
library. The current hot topics:

- merging more audio streams from different applications to one 
  exclusive device in user space (alsa-lib, asound)
- wavetable support (trident, yamaha and other chips)
- finish / reimplement wavetable instrument / soundfont handling
- documentation, documentation, documentation.... 
- working well documented examples...

	Do I miss something?

